WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Mogledge: a local HTML viewer for AI-assisted workflows.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
Open local HTML from the folder tree.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
Compare HTML pages in two columns.

00:09.000 --> 00:15.000
Choose Send to AI and create a request draft.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
Review the draft in a compatible AI app, such as ChatGPT / Codex or Claude Code.

00:20.000 --> 00:23.000
Run interactive HTML tools with explicit input saving through the storage API.

00:23.000 --> 00:26.833
Read. Compare. Iterate. Mogledge for Windows and macOS.
